other brat who didn't fight?

254
00:15:50,100 --> 00:15:52,097
Continue to keep a close eye on him.

255
00:15:52,180 --> 00:15:54,720
I'll send Kirara later as backup. Huh?

256
00:15:55,320 --> 00:15:59,220
I'm feeling a buzz right now that
I haven't felt in a long time.

257
00:15:59,460 --> 00:16:03,217
I haven't felt this alive since
my ex maxed out my credit cards.

258
00:16:03,300 --> 00:16:06,476
I've asked you a million
times not to mention your ex.

259
00:16:08,480 --> 00:16:09,892
Things are looking good.

260
00:16:10,000 --> 00:16:13,059
It won't be too long before
Itadori and Hakari meet.

261
00:16:14,240 --> 00:16:17,457
Tell me, Panda, why haven't you
been able to see Hakari yet?

262
00:16:17,540 --> 00:16:18,370
Hmm.

263
00:16:18,453 --> 00:16:20,177
Well, I do know where he likes to stay.

264
00:16:20,260 --> 00:16:22,142
In the monitor room on the roof.

265
00:16:22,460 --> 00:16:25,048
But I haven't been able
to get close enough.

266
00:16:25,620 --> 00:16:26,640
Wait, why not?

267
00:16:26,880 --> 00:16:30,217
Even when I approach the door, I
can't seem to close the distance.

268
00:16:30,300 --> 00:16:33,241
The sensation feels similar
to Satoru's technique.

269
00:16:33,760 --> 00:16:36,200
It's probably due to Kirara's technique.

270
00:16:37,540 --> 00:16:38,370
Kirara?

271
00:16:38,453 --> 00:16:40,857
But I thought the other
third-year student is a guy.

272
00:16:40,940 --> 00:16:41,777
Yeah, so what?

273
00:16:41,860 --> 00:16:46,380
So this, does that phenomenon only occur
when Kira-ra's in the monitor room?

274
00:16:46,720 --> 00:16:47,600
I'm not sure.

275
00:16:47,880 --> 00:16:50,397
I've been focusing too much
on being a circus panda

276
00:16:50,480 --> 00:16:52,777
instead of pushing more
and making them run off.

277
00:16:52,860 --> 00:16:55,357
I'm just really glad the
two of you showed up.

278
00:16:55,440 --> 00:16:58,077
Do you think Itadori has
a chance to persuade him?

279
00:16:58,160 --> 00:17:01,940
It'll be tough, but it's just a
matter of time before he does.

280
00:17:02,180 --> 00:17:03,517
I think Itadori's light,

281
00:17:03,600 --> 00:17:06,517
charming personality is a good
match for someone like Hakari.

282
00:17:06,600 --> 00:17:09,017
But you won't believe
how bad his acting sucks.

283
00:17:09,100 --> 00:17:10,688
He doesn't just suck at it.

284
00:17:11,240 --> 00:17:13,317
He struggles to even
see lying as an option.

285
00:17:13,400 --> 00:17:17,877
Well, that explains it, but it didn't stop
him from talking trash about my acting.

286
00:17:17,960 --> 00:17:18,790
Anyway,

287
00:17:18,873 --> 00:17:20,557
once Itadori enters the monitor room,

288
00:17:20,640 --> 00:17:23,297
I'll buy him time by taking
control of the place.

289
00:17:23,380 --> 00:17:24,210
Are you sure?

290
00:17:24,340 --> 00:17:25,575
Don't worry about it.

291
00:17:25,760 --> 00:17:26,837
Everything will be fine.

292
00:17:26,920 --> 00:17:29,477
I know where all the cameras
and their blind spots are.

293
00:17:29,560 --> 00:17:31,257
How many guards are in there?

294
00:17:31,340 --> 00:17:35,458
Four at the entrance, and two on
each floor except for up on the roof.

295
00:17:37,380 --> 00:17:38,851
Okay, we can handle that.

296
00:17:39,720 --> 00:17:42,308
The only real concern
is Kirana's technique.

297
00:17:42,560 --> 00:17:44,337
We can't do anything about that now.

298
00:17:44,420 --> 00:17:47,773
If they can warp Itadori out
of there, or warp in backup,

299
00:17:47,980 --> 00:17:49,921
we'll give up on pursuing Hakari.

300
00:17:51,180 --> 00:17:52,640
Wow, you look so young.

301
00:17:52,880 --> 00:17:54,704
Are you still a first-year Yui?

302
00:17:55,100 --> 00:17:55,930
Yui?

303
00:17:56,013 --> 00:17:58,471
Ken had to repeat a year in middle school.

304
00:17:58,580 --> 00:18:00,815
Looks like you have a happy life here.

305
00:18:01,620 --> 00:18:02,560
Well, yeah.

306
00:18:02,880 --> 00:18:06,939
It's been a while since Ken's gotten
all heated up like this, though.

307
00:18:07,400 --> 00:18:11,220
You see, I simply love it
when Kin is passionate.

308
00:18:16,960 --> 00:18:17,790
Mitsudori,

309
00:18:17,873 --> 00:18:21,397
would you believe me if I said
you can earn a million yen a

310
00:18:21,480 --> 00:18:25,068
month by doing something that
takes only an hour a day to do?

311
00:18:25,680 --> 00:18:28,740
Well, I guess it depends
on what that something is.

312
00:18:29,780 --> 00:18:32,477
But you'll have to pay me 200,000 yen to

313
00:18:32,560 --> 00:18:35,560
buy the information on what
that something is. Huh?

314
00:18:36,580 --> 00:18:38,497
In that case, I don't believe you.

315
00:18:38,580 --> 00:18:43,227
Good, because just like you suspected,
I was presenting you with a classic con.

316
00:18:43,340 --> 00:18:45,217
The swindler pretends to be rich,

317
00:18:45,300 --> 00:18:48,997
selling the means to be rich to those
desperate to be rich in a classic scam.

318
00:18:49,080 --> 00:18:51,357
It's obvious if you
think about it logically,

319
00:18:51,440 --> 00:18:54,237
but there's a huge number
of fools who fall for it.

320
00:18:54,320 --> 00:18:55,380
And you know why?

321
00:18:55,600 --> 00:18:57,835
Because it all has to do with passion.

322
00:18:58,480 --> 00:18:59,310
Passion?

323
00:18:59,393 --> 00:19:02,082
Both swindler and swindled
have the same passion.

324
00:19:02,260 --> 00:19:06,436
They both have a compulsive drive to
change their lives for the better.

325
00:19:06,740 --> 00:19:09,799
People high on passion lose
sight of their judgment.

326
00:19:10,020 --> 00:19:13,797
Yet without passion, no one in
the world would ever fall in love.

327
00:19:13,880 --> 00:19:16,320
I love that obsessive passion.

328
00:19:17,060 --> 00:19:20,860
Do you know the most direct
way people deal with passion?

329
00:19:22,140 --> 00:19:22,970
Gambling?

330
00:19:26,200 --> 00:19:28,906
First time I saw you, I
knew you would get it.

331
00:19:29,640 --> 00:19:31,540
After all, life is a gamble.

332
00:19:31,900 --> 00:19:35,657
I can't tell you the number of women that
have dumped me because they hate gambling,

333
00:19:35,740 --> 00:19:38,617
but I think they're the ones
who've got it all wrong.

334
00:19:38,700 --> 00:19:41,557
Our society throws out
those who can't bet big,

335
00:19:41,640 --> 00:19:44,937
as well as those who don't know when to
fold their hands and call it a night.

336
00:19:45,020 --> 00:19:48,140
There isn't a single person
alive who doesn't gamble.

337
00:19:48,480 --> 00:19:53,304
What people hate isn't the gambling, it's
the losing and the being ruined forever.

338
00:19:54,080 --> 00:19:57,617
There must be some people who
just want to live a peaceful life.

339
00:19:57,700 --> 00:19:59,840
Not anyone that I've ever met.

340
00:20:00,260 --> 00:20:03,240
All the people that I know
love passion above all.

341
00:20:03,860 --> 00:20:07,120
Passion equals gambling,
and gambling equals life.

342
00:20:07,720 --> 00:20:09,720
And love equals control.

343
00:20:10,200 --> 00:20:14,680
And I want to control this nation's
passion through my fight club one day.

344
00:20:15,300 --> 00:20:19,937
With the existence of curses going public
and headquarters barely able to function,

345
00:20:20,020 --> 00:20:22,432
this is my chance to expand the business.

346
00:20:22,540 --> 00:20:24,540
I'm going to crush the opposition.

347
00:20:24,820 --> 00:20:27,657
And I'll make them publicly
recognize my fight club

348
00:20:27,740 --> 00:20:30,740
in the coming revisions to
the Jujutsu regulations.

349
00:20:30,940 --> 00:20:34,820
And to do that, I'll need
a strong player on my team.

350
00:20:37,820 --> 00:20:41,320
Itadori, how do you feel about
getting high on my passion?

351
00:20:42,920 --> 00:20:45,240
Look, boss, I need to tell you...

352
00:20:57,440 --> 00:20:59,852
I'm sorry, I haven't offered you a drink.

353
00:21:00,300 --> 00:21:03,157
Oh, I'm good with anything,
really, other than liquor.

354
00:21:03,240 --> 00:21:04,070
What?

355
00:21:04,153 --> 00:21:05,437
Can't handle it or something?

356
00:21:05,520 --> 00:21:08,100
No, it's just I'm still underage.

357
00:21:08,300 --> 00:21:10,777
You don't strike me as the
type to care about that.

358
00:21:10,860 --> 00:21:13,625
Did you know Gojo can't
hold his liquor either?

359
00:21:13,900 --> 00:21:15,200
Yeah, who's Gojo?

360
00:21:16,120 --> 00:21:18,797
And I never said that I
can't, just that I haven't.

361
00:21:18,880 --> 00:21:20,560
So why the act? Huh?

362
00:21:28,420 --> 00:21:32,067
There isn't a single sorcerer
who hasn't heard of Satoru Gojo.

363
00:21:32,320 --> 00:21:34,780
So why did you feign ignorance? Or you?

364
00:21:41,880 --> 00:21:43,600
Sent by Jujutsu High.

365
00:21:49,620 --> 00:21:50,600
L-listen!

366
00:21:52,000 --> 00:21:53,100
Hey! Hey!

367
00:21:55,360 --> 00:22:00,620
When I get a call from Kirara's phone,
it's a signal something's fishy.

368
00:22:03,000 --> 00:22:03,830
Listen!

369
00:22:03,980 --> 00:22:04,820
Save it, kid!

370
00:22:05,200 --> 00:22:07,080
My passion has gone cold!

371
00:23:12,260 --> 00:23:13,660
it's not

372
00:23:16,460 --> 00:23:23,120
I'm afraid I'm afraid I'm not

373
00:23:25,880 --> 00:23:26,780
in the

374
00:23:27,660 --> 00:23:31,817
I'm sure I'm looking forward
to looking forward to

375
00:23:31,900 --> 00:23:38,900
that

376
00:23:55,020 --> 00:23:55,072
circle
